    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Client files must be strictly partitioned; no leakage of data between client files is acceptable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Personal-data protection (GDPR) compliance is also required, with data hosted within the EU, no transfer outside the EU, sensitive data protected by encryption or pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's security certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the EU regulatory frameworks as of 2024, what are the key security and compliance measures our company's must implement to meet the key security and compliance measures we must implement to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, our company's will implement the following key security and compliance measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's ISO 27001 certification, which our company's have held since 2023, demonstrates our company's commitment to information security management. our ISO 27001 certification, which we have held since 2023 covers the development, delivery, and operations of our company's services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data protection, our company's ISO 27701 certification provides a framework for privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This extension to ISO 27001 ensures that our company's can manage personal data in accordance with GDPR principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the confidentiality and integrity of client data, our company's will utilize encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. our company's key management infrastructure is based in the EU, ensuring that sensitive data remains within the EU. our company's will also implement strict partitioning of client files, with logical isolation per client and per mission, to prevent any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Access controls will be enforced through role-based access control (RBAC) and audit logging, which logs every system output and access event." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our company's hosting partner is OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer, our company's can guarantee sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. guarantee aligns with the client's requirement for data to be hosted within the EU and not transferred outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with GDPR, our company's have appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO) and maintain a data processing register. our company's data protection agreement (DPA) is aligned with GDPR Article 28, ensuring that all data processing activities are compliant with relevant regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy, including national professional orders, demonstrates our company's familiarity with the importance of confidentiality and data protection in sensitive environments. our company's security controls include secure software development lifecycle practices such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing conducted by an external provider equivalent to CREST level. our company's also have a vulnerability management process in place with remediation SLAs based on severity, ensuring timely response to potential security issues." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In the event of a breach, our company's incident response plan includes detection, notification, and remediation procedures, aligned with the 72-hour GDPR breach notification requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, our company's Atelier product is designed with explainability and auditability in mind, providing features such as retrieval trace, audit log, and figure source linking. designed supports internal quality control and statutory audit review, ensuring that all outputs are grounded in sources and can be traced back to all outputs origin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures, our company's can ensure the strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, comply with GDPR requirements, and provide a secure environment for hosting and processing sensitive information within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires respect for professional secrecy and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution is a non-decisional assistance tool; the chartered accountant or statutory auditor validates and signs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For statutory-audit (CAC) missions, The solution must respect the auditor's independence and the separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture as of 2024, what are the key legal considerations our company's must address in this project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France with up-to-date social and fiscal obligations, our company, Faber IA, must ensure that our company's respect professional secrecy and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our company's Atelier platform is proprietary software owned by our company, Faber IA, and licensed to the client under a subscription/usage model for the contract term, our company's need to ensure our company's licensing terms are compatible with the requirements of respecting auditor independence and separation of duties. our company's experience in contracting with private firms, regulated professions, and public-sector clients across EU jurisdictions will be beneficial in navigating the regulatory landscape. our company's must pay particular attention to GDPR (including Art. 28 processing agreements), professional secrecy, anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT), auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit, legal retention obligations for accounting documents, and emerging EU AI Act requirements. our company's professional liability insurance of €10 million per claim will provide a level of assurance for the client. our company's should also ensure that our company's standard administrative attestations are available to the client as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the key legal considerations we must address in this project, our company's must: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ensure our company's contractual framework respects auditor independence and separation of duties. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Comply with GDPR and professional secrecy obligations. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Adhere to anti-money-laundering regulations (LCB-FT). 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Respect legal retention obligations for accounting documents. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Monitor emerging EU AI Act requirements and ensure compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing the key legal considerations we must address in this project, our company's can provide a solution that meets the client's requirements while ensuring our company's legal standing and regulatory compliance posture are maintained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget allocated to the project is €220,000 over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual operating cost must remain controlled." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's financials, active project budgets, daily rates, overhead, cash position, tender eligibility thresholds, and cost sensitivity parameters as of 2024, what are our company's projected costs for the project, and how can our company's optimize our projected costs for this project while ensuring the expected quality of service?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, an engagement of €220,000 over 3 years is well within our company's normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget envelope suggests that one-off project costs should account for around 40% of the total budget, which would be approximately €88,000 in the first year, while recurring run costs should account for about 60%, or roughly €132,000 over three years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's daily rates, our company's can estimate the number of days required for each type of consultant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, if our company's allocate a project director at €1,300 per day, a solution architect at €1,100 per day, and other roles like data scientists, senior engineers, and security compliance consultants according to their respective daily rates, our company's can break down the one-off costs into specific tasks and personnel." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while ensuring the expected quality of service, our company's should focus on leveraging our company's cost-efficient tiers and models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The sovereign tier with the sovereign European model is noted as the most cost-efficient configuration for recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By selecting The sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, our company's can minimize hosting and inference expenses, which are identified as main recurring cost drivers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, our company's approach favors cost-efficient solutions that protect the gross margin and the predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This means our company's will prioritize configurations and services that not only meet but exceed client expectations within the allocated budget, ensuring a high level of service quality without compromising on costs. our company's target gross margin range is between 25% and 35%, which indicates our company's aim to balance profitability with competitive pricing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By maintaining a three-year cost model that can be adjusted if requirements or budgets change, our company's ensure flexibility in managing project expenses and adapting to any shifts in client needs or market conditions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, our company's projected costs for the project will be managed within the €220,000 budget over 3 years, with careful allocation of one-off and recurring expenses. our company's will optimize our projected costs for this project by choosing the most cost-efficient options available within our company's capabilities, ensuring high-quality service delivery while maintaining a controlled annual operating cost as required." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide an intelligent assistance tool that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of work. an intelligent assistance tool that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of work should assist with retrieval of regulatory and methodological information, drafting professional documents, support in handling client files, and collaboration between collaborators." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, what are the key AI innovation elements our company's can propose to meet the key AI innovation elements we can propose to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company's company context, our company's can propose the key AI innovation elements we can propose to meet these requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities can be leveraged to provide an intelligent assistance tool that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of work." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The RAG approach allows for every answer to be generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, ensuring that outputs are grounded in validated material. our company's can also utilize our company's hybrid retrieval capabilities, which combine lexical and semantic search, to assist with the retrieval of regulatory and methodological information. utilize will enable the tool to efficiently locate relevant information within the client's documentation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's template-guided drafting capability can be used to support drafting professional documents, such as client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos, and syntheses. used will help ensure that documents are well-structured and consistent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of collaboration between collaborators, our company's platform can facilitate the sharing of relevant information and context, enabling efficient resumption of tasks by another collaborator. our company's can also provide features such as change management support and training to ensure a smooth transition." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's explainability tools, including source citations, retrieved passages, and retrieval trace, will provide transparency into the decision-making process, ensuring that the tool outputs are reliable and trustworthy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

