    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should fit into existing practices and not introduce a rupture in working methods." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The technical constraints include response times below 2 seconds for common queries, high availability during business hours, resilience to seasonal peak loads, integration with accounting-production software, payroll software, document management/ GED, electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environment, API-type interfaces, and user directory (SSO)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is our proposed technical architecture to meet The technical constraints? our proposed technical architecture is based on the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The technical constraints, our propose the following: * the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the firm's professionals' work environment, supporting the firm's professionals' in the firm's professionals' daily activities. * our will use API-first design to integrate the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools with accounting-production software, payroll software, document management/ GED, and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environment. integrate will enable seamless interaction between accounting-production software, payroll software, document management/ GED, and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environment and the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools. * To ensure high availability during business hours and resilience to seasonal peak loads, our will deploy the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools on a cloud infrastructure that can scale horizontally. our hosting options include the Sovereign tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and EU-only, ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements. * For authentication and authorization, our will integrate the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools with the user directory (SSO) using SAML or OIDC protocols, ensuring secure access to the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools. * To meet the response time constraint of below 2 seconds for common queries, our will optimize the Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with various business tools performance by utilizing our median latency of 1.3 seconds and p95 latency of 2.5 seconds or less for common queries on comparable deployments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, Our proposed technical architecture is designed to meet the client's requirements while ensuring integration with existing practices, high availability, and scalability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

